    "identifier": "ranton-storm-release-lightning-whip",
    "description": "<p>You form a current of Water like Lightning in your hand, swiping at a creature within range. Make a ranged ninjutsu attack, dealing 5d6 Lightning damage on a hit and forcing the affected creature to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, their speed is reduced to 0 until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and damage by 1d6. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the number of creatures you can target by +1.</p>",
